# Installed by loop-bootstrap. Everything below is runtime state the team
# regenerates — never commit it. Everything bootstrap installed that is NOT
# listed below (CLAUDE.md, .claude/, .mcp.json, backend/, scripts/, hooks/,
# requirements.txt, .autonomous-team/config.json, .autonomous-team/project.json,
# .autonomous-team/jsonl-rotation.json) is yours to edit and commit.
#
# The rule: bootstrap writes it once and you edit it -> commit it.
#           a loop, agent, hook or test rewrites it  -> it is ignored below.

